{"data":[{"author_id":"1789826195602784256","created_at":"2026-10-11T00:49:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109084029404455211"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":261,"start":257,"tag":"TSM"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/xsg9n3a6Ol","end":299,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Unclestocknotes/status/2109084029404455211/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109083991672508416","start":276,"url":"https://t.co/xsg9n3a6Ol"}]},"id":"2109084029404455211","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1770,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC September revenue hit NT$511.86B, +54.6% YoY. Jan–Sep sales reached NT$3.90T, +41.1%.\n\nMonthly sales imply Q3 revenue of ~NT$1.494T, or ~$46.7B at its NT$32 planning rate—above the $44.6–45.8B guide. Actual USD revenue remains to be confirmed.\n\nStrong $TSM sales support https://t.co/xsg9n3a6Ol","url":"https://x.com/Unclestocknotes/status/2109084029404455211"},{"author_id":"174073808","created_at":"2026-10-10T20:23:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109016955902366173"],"id":"2109016955902366173","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":159,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Week ahead through silicon: ASML and TSMC settle the AI demand debate.\n\n1) The OpenAI scare was accounting, not demand\nThursday FT put OpenAI ARR near $50B and sold chips hard. The gap vs the ~$70B figure was how OpenAI counts cloud-partner sales — not a collapse in GPU pull.","url":"https://x.com/xiangwei36/status/2109016955902366173"},{"author_id":"785856172209373184","created_at":"2026-10-11T07:30:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109184741408645434"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uv0nAr5Kxt","end":306,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2109184741408645434/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109184738040668160","start":283,"url":"https://t.co/uv0nAr5Kxt"}]},"id":"2109184741408645434","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":112,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Dossier dominical IA &amp; semi — catalyseurs de la semaine (Paris, 11 oct. 2026)\n\n1) ASML — Q3 jeudi 14/10, guidance déjà posée (55–57% GM)\n\nASML annoncera ses résultats T3 2026 mercredi 14 octobre à 07:00 CET, avec call à 15:00. La société avait guidé un CA T3 de €11–12 Md et une https://t.co/uv0nAr5Kxt","url":"https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2109184741408645434"},{"author_id":"1742035208906661888","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:56:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109100695135883409"],"id":"2109100695135883409","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":81,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC just hired GlobalFoundries to make silicon interposers for its CoWoS packaging — in upstate New York. 5-year deal, ~$2B, volume output H1 2028. It's the first US-based source for the part that holds every AI accelerator together.\n\nA silicon interposer is the slab under the","url":"https://x.com/zhyblife99/status/2109100695135883409"},{"author_id":"1680972033851785217","created_at":"2026-10-11T10:03:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109223248277758259"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":226,"start":211,"tag":"Semiconductors"},{"end":230,"start":227,"tag":"AI"}]},"id":"2109223248277758259","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"GlobalFoundries and TSMC signed a $2B deal to make silicon interposers in New York, the first US-based source of the part CoWoS AI packaging needs, ramping only in H1 2028. The dies and HBM still attach abroad. #Semiconductors #AI","url":"https://x.com/j0SH24a/status/2109223248277758259"},{"author_id":"95134466","created_at":"2026-10-10T07:32:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108822889642566073"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KaLTFz57bm","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SVTrivo/status/2108822889642566073/photo/1","media_key":"3_2108822878384955392","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/KaLTFz57bm"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KaLTFz57bm","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SVTrivo/status/2108822889642566073/photo/1","media_key":"3_2108822884709986304","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/KaLTFz57bm"}]},"id":"2108822889642566073","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1545,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"About 20 years ago, I taped out a few chips at GlobalFoundries.  \nAfter that, the opportunity never came again.\n\nBack then, GF was always a step behind. It eventually stepped away from the leading-edge race below 7nm and repositioned itself around analog, RF, and specialty https://t.co/KaLTFz57bm","url":"https://x.com/SVTrivo/status/2108822889642566073"},{"author_id":"6611952","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108794658436313258"],"id":"2108794658436313258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":112,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"米株市場では主要指数が高値圏を維持した一方、AI関連とバイオ株が弱含み、半導体ETFは週間で4.3％下落した。次週はTSMCとASMLの決算がAI設備投資の持続性を測る最初の大型材料となり、JPMorganやGoldman","url":"https://x.com/got/status/2108794658436313258"},{"author_id":"1789826195602784256","created_at":"2026-10-11T00:51:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109084521501282573"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":115,"start":111,"tag":"TSM"},{"end":137,"start":132,"tag":"NVDA"},{"end":161,"start":156,"tag":"ASML"},{"end":168,"start":163,"tag":"AMAT"},{"end":175,"start":170,"tag":"LRCX"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/XExAZPIxUG","end":199,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Unclestocknotes/status/2109084521501282573/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109084510495350784","start":176,"url":"https://t.co/XExAZPIxUG"}]},"id":"2109084521501282573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3416,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"台積電9月營收5,118.6億元，年增54.6%；前三季累計3.90兆元，年增41.1%。\n加總月營收，Q3約1.494兆元；以公司規劃匯率32元換算，約467億美元，高於原財測446–458億，實際美元營收仍待確認。\n\n$TSM 的強勁表現支持AI晶片需求，對 $NVDA 是正面訊號；若後續擴產延續，設備商 $ASML、 $AMAT、 $LRCX https://t.co/XExAZPIxUG","url":"https://x.com/Unclestocknotes/status/2109084521501282573"},{"author_id":"76407611","created_at":"2026-10-10T12:25:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108896615369150563"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":108,"start":103,"tag":"NVDA"}]},"id":"2108896615369150563","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":191,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【Market Breakdown】\n中国「脱NVIDIA」とAI半導体「分断」の衝撃\n【衝撃】NVIDIAの中国特化チップ「H20」が売れない理由\n中国産GPU「Biren BR100」との圧倒的性能差\n$NVDA \n\n主な内容\n**オープニング：中国「脱NVIDIA」とAI半導体分断の衝撃\n**序章：EUV制裁の破綻とパラレルワールドの開幕","url":"https://x.com/KoujiSato19/status/2108896615369150563"},{"article":{"title":"AI chip packaging brings production steps together"},"author_id":"1736295946974265344","created_at":"2026-10-10T02:07:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108741279396094240"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2108…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2108281036002209792","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2108281036002209792","url":"https://t.co/HeZWu7JFXu"}]},"id":"2108741279396094240","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":157,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/HeZWu7JFXu","url":"https://x.com/NanshanTalk/status/2108741279396094240"},{"author_id":"1078647340754456577","created_at":"2026-10-11T14:17:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109287186176897400"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/eH7VMYcdfp","end":146,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/bitpanda88/status/2109287186176897400/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109287098322927616","start":123,"url":"https://t.co/eH7VMYcdfp"}]},"id":"2109287186176897400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":607,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count