4905996735"},{"author_id":"1874887449404448769","created_at":"2026-10-11T11:07:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109239336768049612"],"id":"2109239336768049612","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2468,"like_count":13,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"下周半导体行业可能迎来10月份最重要的两份财报！10月14日$ASML公布第三季度业绩，10月15日$TSM公布第三季度完整财报。我认为这两家公司给出的2027年展望，可能比单纯的季度利润更值得整个华尔街关注！\n\n为什么？因为$ASML和$TSM分别站在全球半导体产业链非常关键的位置。\n\n先看$TSM台积电。","url":"https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2109239336768049612"},{"author_id":"195621768","created_at":"2026-10-10T03:10:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108756908752650477"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"GlobalFoundriesが、TSMCと20億米ドル規模の製造契約を締結したと発表した。TSMCの先端パッケージング技術「CoWoS（Chip on Wafer on Substrate）」向けに、シリコンインターポーザーを米国で製造する。","display_url":"eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/26…","end":81,"expanded_url":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2610/09/news081.html","images":[{"height":570,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108497798484377601/IZjCZ3f-?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1090},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108497798484377601/IZjCZ3f-?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":58,"status":200,"title":"GFがTSMCの「CoWoS」用Siインターポーザー米国生産","unwound_url":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2610/09/news081.html","url":"https://t.co/Mb38LlRXlL"}]},"id":"2108756908752650477","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"GFがTSMCの「CoWoS」用Siインターポーザー米国生産：2028年に量産へ - EE Times Japan https://t.co/Mb38LlRXlL\nGlobalFoundriesが、TSMCと20億米ドル規模の製造契約を締結したと発表した。TSMCの先端パッケージング技術「CoWoS」向けに、シリコンインターポーザーを米国で製造する。","url":"https://x.com/S_orza/status/2108756908752650477"},{"author_id":"1201051959869857793","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:48:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108872342378312111"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/b8iXns7CtR","end":252,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/nazrielnr_/s